7
00:01:42,479 --> 00:01:43,479
was not my intention.

8
00:01:43,479 --> 00:01:44,210
That's fine.

9
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:44,880
I'm only here

10
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:46,479
because my family pushed me.

11
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,600
Let's get straight to the point.

12
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,400
Let's sign a

13
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,280
marriage agreement for three years.

14
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,640
Once the three years are up,

15
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,840
we will get a divorce.

16
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:54,960
During this time,

17
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,620
you don't have to do anything.

18
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,960
You just need to

19
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:59,280
play the role of a good wife in front of the public

20
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,040
and my family.

21
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,560
Of course,

22
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:03,880
during the agreement,

23
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:05,040
I will try my best to meet

24
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,400
any requests you have.

25
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,180
But just one thing.

26
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,000
I don't have much time to spend with you.

27
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,680
Because I am at home

28
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:13,650
for no more than thirty days a year.

29
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:21,810
You are Pei Song.

30
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,760
Let me state clearly first,

31
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:29,960
coming to this blind date

32
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:30,720
is not my real intention.

33
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,040
Whatever the reason,

34
00:02:32,079 --> 00:02:33,000
since you're here,

35
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,000
just give it a try.

36
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,960
We can see if the elders' recommendation

37
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:36,960
is accurate.

38
00:02:37,079 --> 00:02:37,810
How about it?

39
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:43,280
What's wrong?

40
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,660
What do you want to say?

41
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,600
Nothing.

42
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:47,760
I just feel

43
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,040
you are somewhat different

44
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,240
from what people say.

45
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,000
So you are Song Shiya.

46
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,160
We

47
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,480
still have plenty of time

48
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:02,880
to get to know each other.

49
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:09,440
Well,

50
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,280
can we first

51
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,520
sign an agreement?

52
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:17,040
Agreement?

53
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:18,920
Let's sign

54
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,850
a three-year marriage agreement.

55
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,490
What agreement?

56
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,320
Although I know

57
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,920
it doesn't follow the rules,

58
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,160
I am really not ready

59
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,160
for marriage.

60
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,800
What I mean is,

61
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,200
we just met.

62
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,680
After getting married,

63
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,320
can we live as friends

64
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,680
for a while first?

65
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,200
If it works out,

66
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,740
we'll take it further.

67
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:51,120
If it doesn't work out,

68
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,680
it's better to separate.

69
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,840
You mean

70
00:03:58,040 --> 00:03:59,700
we divorce when the time is up?

71
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,360
For example,

72
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:05,720
