73
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:06,640
Three years.

74
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:09,640
What?

75
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:12,340
You must stay with me for three years.

76
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,680
If the time is up

77
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,360
and you feel it doesn't work out,

78
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,490
we can divorce then.

79
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,410
I will respect your wishes.

80
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,200
Shiya.

81
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,240
This time,

82
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,440
I won't let go again.

83
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,640
Copy the code he wrote

84
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:05,400
onto this USB drive,

85
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:06,600
and you're good to go.

86
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:11,240
When are you planning to get married and move in?

87
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,360
In the next couple of days.

88
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,960
We won't be having a wedding.

89
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:15,240
Keep in touch.

90
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:31,280
You sleep in the master bedroom from now on,

91
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:32,800
and I'll take the guest room.

92
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,520
Thank you.

93
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,760
I saw on your profile

94
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:41,690
