95
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:44,010
That's very thoughtful of you.

96
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,540
Have you been to all these places?

97
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,960
I went to all of them with you.

98
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,080
No.

99
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:57,280
But

100
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,400
if you want to go,

101
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:00,130
we can find time to go together.

102
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:09,300
Have you read all these books too?

103
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:12,120
I read all of these specifically

104
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,620
to understand you better.

105
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:16,080
I've read most of them.

106
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,520
I didn't expect we'd have

107
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,560
so much in common.

108
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,640
What's wrong, Shiya?

109
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,440
What's wrong?

110
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:49,880
I'm sorry.

111
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:50,960
I didn't mean it.

112
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,159
Are you okay?

113
00:06:52,159 --> 00:06:52,840
I'll do it.

114
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:55,120
Don't do it.

115
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,480
Are you hurt?

116
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:05,720
What's wrong?

117
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:07,400
I...

118
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,330
The smoke got in my eyes.

119
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:12,320
Let me take a look.

120
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,040
I'll

121
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,720
get the door.

122
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,370
I'll be right there after I change.

123
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:55,170
Grandpa.

124
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:55,960
Okay.

125
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,370
Grandpa,

126
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:01,660
why are you suddenly here?

127
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,320
It's so late.

128
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:04,800
What?

129
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:07,800
Can't I come see my granddaughter-in-law?

130
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,440
I was planning

131
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:11,000
to take her to see you tomorrow

132
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,560
and have a meal together.

133
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,680
What do you mean?

134
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,880
Am I not welcome here?

135
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,120
No.

136
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:19,680
I mean,

137
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,920
it's very late now

138
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,560
and we were about to rest.

139
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,560
I'm staying here today

140
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,490
and not leaving.

141
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,400
What's with the 'ah'?

142
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,450
Don't you have a guest room?

143
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,320
Grandpa.

144
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,679
Well.

145
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:40,600
When I lived alone,

146
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,919
you could come anytime.

147
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:42,919
But now,

148
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,960
Shiya is at home.

149
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:44,800
Isn't it a bit

150
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,200
inappropriate?

151
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,920
Why is it inappropriate?

152
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,280
You sleep in your room,

153
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,340
and I sleep in mine.

154
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:52,010
How is that inappropriate?

155
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,210
Alright.

156
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:57,200
Don't worry.

157
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,640
Whatever noises you make at night,

158
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:01,480
I won't hear a thing.

159
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:03,760
It won't affect my rest.

160
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,800
Grandpa.

161
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:08,800
Well.

162
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:10,560
Okay.

163
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,320
Grandpa,

164
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,480
