165
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,880
I'll go prepare the guest room.

166
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:14,560
No.

167
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,220
As for this,

168
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,640
don't worry about it.

169
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,200
Let Song do it.

170
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,320
Sit down.

171
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:21,640
You.

172
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,200
Just stay with Grandpa

173
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,880
and chat.

174
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,280
Why haven't you gone yet?

175
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,400
Hurry up.

176
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,120
This brat.

177
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:33,720
Okay.

178
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,240
He wouldn't even let me stay.

179
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,320
Is he shy?

180
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:36,880
No,

181
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,120
of course not.

182
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:58,720
Pei Song.

183
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,500
Don't misunderstand.

184
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,640
I'll sleep on the floor.

185
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:18,840
You'll just have to make do for tonight.

186
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,760
After Grandpa leaves,

187
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:21,680
I'll sleep in the guest room.
